{"request_id": "steady_real-002", "scenario": "steady_real", "send_offset_s": 40.019, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1034.5, "total_ms": 1034.5, "waiting_ms": 0.1, "working_ms": 1032.7, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 2057, "tokens_out": 139, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "How many steps and how many hours did the Transformer base models train for, and on what hardware?", "answer": "The Transformer base models were trained for a total of 100,000 steps, which took 12 hours [Attention Is All You Need, p.7]. This training was conducted on one machine equipped with 8 NVIDIA P100 GPUs [Attention Is All You Need, p.7]. The paper notes that this duration allows the model to reach a new state of the art in translation quality [Attention Is All You Need, p.2].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 40.019403899998, "qid": "q03", "tier": "full", "planned_in": 1634, "planned_out": 196, "predicted_wait_s": 0.0, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.77, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 0.6}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 0.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 308.5}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 308.5, "end_ms": 309.9}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 310.0, "end_ms": 310.1}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 310.1, "end_ms": 741.9}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 742.0, "end_ms": 742.0}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 742.1, "end_ms": 1033.8}], "first_token_at_ms": 1034.5, "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "qid": "q03"}
{"request_id": "steady_real-003", "scenario": "steady_real", "send_offset_s": 60.017, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1081.8, "total_ms": 1081.8, "waiting_ms": 0.1, "working_ms": 1080.0, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1639, "tokens_out": 171, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "Why do the Transformer authors scale the dot products by 1/sqrt(dk)?", "answer": "The authors scale dot products by $1/\\sqrt{d_k}$ because, for large values of $d_k$, the dot products grow large in magnitude [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. This growth pushes the softmax function into regions where it has extremely small gradients [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. Scaling counteracts this effect to maintain stable gradients [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. The dot product of query and key vectors, assuming independent random variables with mean 0 and variance 1, has a variance of $d_k$ [Attention Is All You Need, p.4].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 60.01690960000269, "qid": "q04", "tier": "full", "planned_in": 1623, "planned_out": 186, "predicted_wait_s": 0.0, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.488, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.2, "end_ms": 0.3}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 0.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 349.2}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 349.2, "end_ms": 350.2}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 350.4, "end_ms": 350.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 350.4, "end_ms": 809.8}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 809.9, "end_ms": 809.9}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 809.9, "end_ms": 1080.7}], "first_token_at_ms": 1081.8, "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "qid": "q04"}
